        ":::{#eq-fs-hay-8}\n",
        "[[**FS.HAY.8**]]{.aside .content-visible when-format=\"html\"}    \n",
        "$$\n",
        "\\text{M} = \\text{F}_\\text{i} \\times \\frac{max(0.0, \\text{moisture} - \\text{MF})}{100} \\times \\frac{min(30,\\text{d})}{30} \n",
